# the Python packages needed to build the user's guide. The pip-compile utility
# provided by the pip-tools package is used to generate the full list of
# dependencies.
#
# pip install pip-tools
# pip-compile requirements.in
#
# The resulting requirements are copied to the requirements-doc.txt file in the
# root directory of this repository.

